<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 15-JAN.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 15-JAN.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone 17P is becoming extratropical west of Tahiti near 20s/166w. The storm is moving south southeast at 10 mph. Top winds are 60 mph but weakening. This system threatens only shipping.</p>
<p>There are no further statements at this time.</p>
